<title>UK: Christiania Bank sets 300 mln mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Christiania Bank sets 300 mln mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHRISTIANIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN MARK  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.942    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
